      "parameters": {
        "content": "# INF-001 · Report export controller\n\nPolls the control sheet; for each requested period it selects the companies and calls the **reusable sub-workflows**: prerequisite check · Report package: Payroll · Report package: VAT (both call the shared **HTML → PDF** sub-workflow).",
